            <title><![CDATA[Family of Marine veteran imprisoned in Russia warns he's near death]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/family-of-marine-veteran-imprisoned-in-russia-warns-hes-near-death</link>
            <description><![CDATA[The family of a U.S. Marine veteran imprisoned in Russia says his health is deteriorating and he may be on the brink of death. Robert Gilman was arrested in Russia in 2022 for allegedly hitting a Russian police officer. He was sentenced to four and a half years in prison, but that sentence has since been extended to a decade. Stephanie Sy spoke with Kieran Ramsey, Gilman's advocate in the U.S.]]></description>
